				\begin{document}$$ {\mathrm{O}}_2^{-} $$\end{document}O2−/O2− than S1, S2, and S4, and the results indicated that S3 had the highest ability for adsorbing ionized oxygen species, which may contribute to increasing the sensing performance [39].
